1956 年李政道和杨振宁提出在弱相互作用中宇称不守恒，并由吴健雄用 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="\ce{^{60}_{27}Co}" data-display="0">\ce{^{60}_{27}Co}</span> 放射源进行了实验验证，次年，李、杨二人为此获得诺贝尔物理奖，<span class="math-tex" data-tex="\ce{^{60}_{27}Co}" data-display="0">\ce{^{60}_{27}Co}</span> 的衰变方程是<br><br><span class="math-tex" data-tex=" \ce{^{60}_{27}Co -&gt; ^{A}_{Z}Ni + ^{0}_{-1}e +  ar{
u}_{e}} " data-display="1"> \ce{^{60}_{27}Co -&gt; ^{A}_{Z}Ni + ^{0}_{-1}e +  ar{
u}_{e}} </span><br><br>其中 <span class="math-tex" data-tex=" ar{
u}_{e}" data-display="0"> ar{
u}_{e}</span> 是反中微子，它的电荷为零，静止质量可认为是零。<br><br><ol class="subquestions"><li>Co 与 Fe 同周期，它应在周期表的第 <span class="answer-blank">________</span> 周期。<span class="math-tex" data-tex="\ce{^{60}_{27}Co}" data-display="0">\ce{^{60}_{27}Co}</span> 的核外电子数为 <span class="answer-blank">________</span>。在上述衰变方程中，衰变产物 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="\ce{^{A}_{Z}Ni}" data-display="0">\ce{^{A}_{Z}Ni}</span> 的质量数 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="A" data-display="0">A</span> 是 <span class="answer-blank">________</span>，核电荷数 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="Z" data-display="0">Z</span> 是 <span class="answer-blank">________</span>。</li><li>在衰变前 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="\ce{^{60}_{27}Co}" data-display="0">\ce{^{60}_{27}Co}</span> 核静止，根据云室照片可以看出，衰变产物 Ni 和 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="\ce{^{0}_{-1}e}" data-display="0">\ce{^{0}_{-1}e}</span> 的运动径迹不在一条直线上。如果认为衰变产物只有 Ni 和 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="\ce{^{0}_{-1}e}" data-display="0">\ce{^{0}_{-1}e}</span>，那么衰变过程将违背 <span class="answer-blank">________</span> 守恒定律。</li><li>无水 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="\ce{CoCl2}" data-display="0">\ce{CoCl2}</span> 为深蓝色，吸水后变为粉红色的水合物，水合物受热后又变成无水 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="\ce{CoCl2}" data-display="0">\ce{CoCl2}</span>，故常在实验室中用作吸湿剂和空气湿度指示剂。<br><br>	<span class="math-tex" data-tex=" {\ce{CoCl2}}_{	ext{深蓝色}}\cdot\ce{ &lt;=&gt;[	ext{吸水}][	riangle] }{\ce{CoCl2}}_{	ext{粉红色}}\cdot x\ce{H2O} " data-display="1"> {\ce{CoCl2}}_{	ext{深蓝色}}\cdot\ce{ &lt;=&gt;[	ext{吸水}][	riangle] }{\ce{CoCl2}}_{	ext{粉红色}}\cdot x\ce{H2O} </span><br><br>	现有无水 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="\ce{CoCl2}" data-display="0">\ce{CoCl2}</span> <span class="math-tex" data-tex="65\Ug" data-display="0">65\Ug</span>，吸水后变成 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="\ce{CoCl2.$x$H2O}" data-display="0">\ce{CoCl2.$x$H2O}</span> <span class="math-tex" data-tex="119\Ug" data-display="0">119\Ug</span>，水合物中 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="x" data-display="0">x</span> 的值是 <span class="answer-blank">________</span>。</li><li><span class="math-tex" data-tex="\ce{^{60}_{27}Co}" data-display="0">\ce{^{60}_{27}Co}</span> 是典型的 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="\gamma" data-display="0">\gamma</span> 放射源，可用于作物诱变育种。我国应用该方法培育出了许多农作物新品种，如棉花高产品种“鲁棉 1 号”，年种植面积曾达到 3000 多万亩，在我国自己培育的棉花品种中栽培面积最大。<span class="math-tex" data-tex="\gamma" data-display="0">\gamma</span> 射线处理作物后主要引起 <span class="answer-blank">________</span>，从而产生可遗传的变异。除 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="\gamma" data-display="0">\gamma</span> 射线，用于人工诱变的其它射线还有 <span class="answer-blank">________</span>、<span class="answer-blank">________</span> 和 <span class="answer-blank">________</span>。</li></ol>
